<section class="sources">
<p class="sec-eyebrow">证据</p>
<h2>来源与深入阅读</h2>
<ol>
<li>Hume, D. (1739–40). <em>A Treatise of Human Nature</em>, Book I, Part III; and (1748) <em>An Enquiry Concerning Human Understanding</em>, §VII. <span class="meta">— 恒常结合；无可见的必然联系。</span></li>
