<li>Lewis, D. (1973). "Causation." <em>Journal of Philosophy</em> 70(17): 556–567. <span class="meta">doi:10.2307/2025310.</span> <a href="https://doi.org/10.2307/2025310">doi.org/10.2307/2025310</a> 另见 Lewis, <em>Counterfactuals</em> (Blackwell, 1973)；修订后的 "influence" 论述 (2000)。</li>
